Inline Common Type EducationContentSource
    documentation 'Published papers, reports, or other educational documents.
    reference EducationContent
        documentation 'Relates the education content source to the education content.
        is optional collection
    string LearningResourceMetadataURI
        documentation 'The URI (typical a URL) pointing to the metadata entry in a LRMI metadata 
